<title>NORWAY: Hydro shares jump on Q1 result.</title>
<headline>Hydro shares jump on Q1 result.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Norwegian industrial giant Norsk Hydro ASA rose sharply on Monday following the release of the company's first-quarter profits.</p>
<p>The share was up 15 crowns, or 4.52 percent, at 347 crowns after one hour of trading on the Oslo Bourse. Turnover in Hydro was 80 million crowns.</p>
<p>The first-quarter result beat market expectations.</p>
<p>--Rolf Soderlind, Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
